    "type": "comment",
    "z": "ex13-tab",
    "name": "Telemetry wall",
    "info": "Five In subscriptions keyed by (message, sysid, compid). ATTITUDE rate-limited 5 Hz; HEARTBEAT changed-only; GLOBAL_POSITION_INT 4 Hz sysid 1; VFR_HUD has no rate/changed filters (contrast with filtered views). Optional inject sets GLOBAL_POSITION_INT interval via set_message_interval (see example 15). SITL bind 14550 \u2192 14551.",
